WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.210
NARRATOR: The social worker
tells Tomás not to worry,

2
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.310
that everything he says is
completely confidential,

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.850
and that nothing will ever leave the room.

4
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:13.890
TOMÁS: Everything?

5
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:14.660
All right.

6
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.500
Then I can say it.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.540
I'm not sleeping because I'm scared
of what I'll do if I do sleep.

8
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.490
Last week I stood on the roof
at the site for a long time.

9
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.020
I have the pills from
my brother's cabinet.

10
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.170
I counted them.

11
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.910
You said nothing leaves this room.

12
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.570
So that stays here, right?

13
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.070
You gave me your word.

14
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.190
Because if you call somebody, I walk
out that door and I don't come back.

15
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.020
And my brother never knows I was here.

16
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.150
NARRATOR: Tomás has disclosed
a plan and the means.

17
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.750
You promised him total privacy.

18
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.370
What do you do now?
